chx:Research a res:ResearchProject ; rdfs:label "Sending email, texts and push notifications for an advanced course: chapter 20 and today's EZGmail, Gmail API, smtplib, imaplib, SMS gateways and ntfy"@en ;
    sen0414:methodology "Primary source first: the chapter's named concepts from the textbook ontology built over the published chapter. Then the official documentation for the current release and the PEPs the chapter's topics touch. Every source opened and read on 2026-10-13T12:00:00; every claim taken from text actually read; every behaviour executed under Python 3.14.6." ;
    res:hasResearchScope chx:Scope ; rdfs:member chx:P01, chx:P02, chx:P03, chx:P04, chx:P05, chx:P06, chx:P07, chx:P08, chx:P09, chx:P10, chx:P11, chx:P12, chx:P13, chx:P14, chx:P15, chx:P16, chx:P17, chx:P18, chx:P19, chx:P20, chx:P21, chx:P22, chx:P23, chx:P24, chx:P25, chx:P26, chx:P27, chx:P28, chx:P29, chx:P30, chx:P31, chx:P32, chx:P33, chx:P34, chx:P35, chx:P36, chx:P37, chx:P38, chx:P39, chx:P40, chx:P41, chx:P42, chx:P43, chx:P44, chx:P45, chx:P46, chx:P47, chx:P48, chx:P49, chx:P50, chx:P51, chx:P52, chx:P53, chx:P54, chx:P55, chx:P56, chx:P57, chx:P58, chx:P59, chx:P60, chx:P61, chx:P62, chx:P63, chx:P64, chx:P65, chx:P66, chx:P67, chx:P68, chx:P69, chx:P70, chx:P71, chx:P72 .
chx:Scope a res:ResearchScope ; res:hasResearchQuestion "What does chapter 20 of the 3rd edition teach about sending and reading email with EZGmail and the Gmail API, texting through SMS email gateways and sending push notifications through ntfy, which of its printed outputs, listings and statements still hold under Python 3.14.6 (with ezgmail 2026.4.28 and requests 2.34.2, and with the Requests version its Appendix A pins), and what must an advanced course correct or add so that it matches the Gmail API, the email, smtplib and imaplib modules of the standard library, the state of the SMS gateways and the real behaviour of ntfy?" ; res:hasTimeWindow "Current as of 2026-10-13." .
